  "comments": "<p>Sir Alexander Bustamante was the first Prime Minister of Jamaica.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In 2000 a Brilliant Uncirculated set was issued to commemorate the 40th Anniversary of The Bank of Jamaica.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6584b52342e82.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6584b52342e82.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Two main types are known.</p><p><i>Reverse</i><br>Type <strong>A</strong> - squat font to bottom line, narrow R far from A in DOLLAR.<br>Type <strong>B</strong> - high font to bottom line, wide R near A in DOLLAR.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6698f1182cfd5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6698f1182cfd5.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Combinations</i></p><p><strong>A</strong>: 1994-1996, 1999, 2003, 2005.<br><strong>B</strong>: 2006, 2008.</p>",
